Package: go-openai-import-to-joplin
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: go-openai-import-to-joplin contributors <noreply@github.com>
Description: Import ChatGPT exports and Codex sessions into Joplin
 A command-line importer for manually downloaded ChatGPT exports and local
 Codex session JSONL files. It writes Markdown notes through the local Joplin
 Web Clipper API.
